# UI agent instructions

This package is the Zelavis dashboard UI.

## Stack

- TanStack Start
- TanStack Router
- shadcn/ui
- Tailwind CSS
- Radix-based components

## Important rules

- Do not hand-edit `src/routeTree.gen.ts`. It is generated.
- Prefer editing route source files under `src/routes/*`.
- Keep the current Radix-based shadcn setup unless a migration is explicitly requested.
- Keep the existing visual language unless the task asks for redesign.
- The sidebar navigation is slide-based; each slide should behave like its own sidebar panel.
- The `Community` section belongs inside the first slide.

## Dev workflow

- Prefer the workspace command `pnpm run ui:dev` for full dashboard iteration.
- That runs Zelavis on port 3000 and the UI dev server on port 3001.
- In that mode, `/zelavis` dashboard requests redirect to the live UI dev server.

## shadcn usage

Use the latest version of shadcn when adding a new component:

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add button
```
